Z||000000||FIERO1985||12-02-2000||02:55 PM||||I have a question what is the best way to paint a fiero and how much paint does it take to paint the car. And does anyone know someone in ohio who does a good paintjob and if not how long and hard is it to do it yourself?||||reg||1
